bel=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(R)\\Rightarrow\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(X\\le_m A\\land A\\le_m X\\land\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\le_K R\\land\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)\\le_C R\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(R)\\Rightarrow\\bigl|\\{A\\in2^\\omega:A\\le_KR\\}\\bigr|=\\bigl|\\{A\\in2^\\omega:A\\le_CR\\}\\bigr|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(R)\\Rightarrow\\bigl|\\{A\\in2^\\omega:A\\le_KR\\}\\bigr|=\\bigl|\\{A\\in2^\\omega:A\\le_CR\\}\\bigr|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中用指数稀疏的位置编码任意集，初段复杂度只有对数级。原稿对每个m度的证明略去两个端点：X为空集或全集时分别直接选A=X；非平凡X可选择一个正例与一个反例处理填充位置。正文将K与C两项并列，均保留统一加法常数。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.2.1; Corollary 14.2.2; printed pp.386–387 / PDF pp.406–407。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-complexity-red","status":"resolved","id":"9d68ed64bfec741d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-complexity-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"ac13d054390a6b63","anchor":"ref-4","tar